    """Cheap H5 metadata peek: return wrist depth (H, W) or None on failure.

    Used by the main loop to bucket episodes by wrist resolution before
    chunking into batches. Mixed-resolution batches crash BatchedSAM3D's
    `_stack_preprocessed` since `torch.cat` requires shape match on non-batch
    dims. Reading the dataset shape is an attribute lookup, not a data read.
    """
